<title>POLAND: Citroen Poland issues PLN 15 mln 35-day CPs.</title>
<headline>Citroen Poland issues PLN 15 mln 35-day CPs.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish subsidiary of France's PSA Peugeot-Citroen issued 15 million zlotys worth of 35-day commercial paper at a yield of 19.00 percent, the issue's buyer, Societe Generale in Warsaw, said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The bank will now sell the paper on the secondary market.</p>
<p>The notes were a part of Citroen Poland's two-year zloty issue programme, guaranteed by Citroen Automobile France.</p>
<p>The value date for the issue is December 2, and the paper matures on January 6, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
